### Executive Summary

This report provides an overview of maritime operations conducted by Oceanic Logistics Solutions, Inc. during the third quarter of 2023. It encompasses vessel utilization, port logistics, container management, and the overall efficiency of our maritime operations. The data and analysis presented herein are intended to inform stakeholders about performance metrics, challenges faced, and future strategic directions.

### 1. Overview of Operations

Oceanic Logistics Solutions operates a fleet of 12 vessels, including container ships and bulk carriers, servicing major ports along the Pacific Coast and connecting to international shipping routes. Our primary operational ports are Los Angeles (USA), Vancouver (Canada), and Yokohama (Japan).

